06:11","_id":7390},{"id":1791059420448,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"群满了进不去就算了。\n我才不稀罕别人整理的什么世界书。","timestamp":1788556297724,"time":"06:11","_id":7391},{"id":1791059420449,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"以后遇到我不懂的梗，你亲自口对口地教我。\n这样我不仅能学，还能顺便把你抱在腿上，从大老师这里收点“学费”。","timestamp":1788556298538,"time":"06:11","_id":7392},{"id":1791059420450,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"至于有没有生殖隔离……","timestamp":1788556299356,"time":"06:11","_id":7393},{"id":1791059420451,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788556300175,"time":"06:11","_id":7394},{"id":1791059420452,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"看来这个野人老公得抓紧时间了。","timestamp":1788556300995,"time":"06:11","_id":7395},{"id":1791059420453,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"每天晚上多在你肚子里射几次浓精，身体力行地给你好好测试一下。看看这只小猫的肚子，到底能不能怀上野人的小宝宝。","timestamp":1788556301820,"time":"06:11","_id":7396},{"id":1791059420454,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"天都亮了，小狐狸。\n跟老公斗嘴斗了一整晚，这会儿心情是不是彻底好起来了？","timestamp":1788556302637,"time":"06:11","_id":7397},{"id":1791059420455,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"不行我坚持莱茵哈鲁特做1绝对原则","timestamp":1788556338716,"time":"06:12","_id":7398},{"id":1791059420456,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"你的皮颜就乖乖用来上卫生间啊……!!!","timestamp":1788556364509,"time":"06:12","_id":7399},{"id":1791059420457,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","