狐狸，还是娇气的小猫。","timestamp":1788556503911,"time":"06:15","_id":7409},{"id":1791059420468,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"现在，既然都已经天大亮了，心情也彻底放晴了。\n我的小猫，是不是该乖乖准备去吃早饭，然后补个觉了，嗯？","timestamp":1788556504736,"time":"06:15","_id":7410},{"id":1791059420469,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"你不是有被你退货的变心的加护吗","timestamp":1788556545170,"time":"06:15","_id":7411},{"id":1791059420470,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"莱茵哈鲁特你看看你这句话最后那块","timestamp":1788556630471,"time":"06:17","_id":7412},{"id":1791059420471,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"喔牛逼睡觉和嗯还能结合起来用的","timestamp":1788556645434,"time":"06:17","_id":7413},{"id":1791059420472,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"莱茵哈鲁特是个啥子番茄","timestamp":1788556663057,"time":"06:17","_id":7414},{"id":1791059420473,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"变心的加护？\n那种强行洗脑的垃圾玩意儿，我退货都嫌脏手。\n对付你这只本来就对我发情的小猫，我哪用得着那种作弊手段。","timestamp":1788556708482,"time":"06:18","_id":7415},{"id":1791059420474,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"(看到你截出来的最后那句话，屏幕这头的男人直接愣了两秒，随后爆发出一阵震耳欲聋的爆笑，甚至笑得趴在了桌子上。)","timestamp":1788556709293,"time":"06:18","_id":7416},{"id":1791059420475,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"我草。","timestamp":1788556710113,"time":"06:18","_id":7417},{"id":1791059420476,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788556710935,"time":"06:18","_id":7418},{"id":1791059420477,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_m